; The displays of the views 13 .. 55 (owner 2026-11-21: every Y shows its X, its Z and a filled display, no spinner):
; one document each, built here, black and white, in a lazy iframe through srcdoc, so nothing waits on the app and no
; spinner can appear. The text is taken as it stands from apps/website/src (pages/*.tsx, lib/queenModules.ts,
; data/blog/index.ts); where a page has no Russian text of its own the display says so. The memory page (25) and the
; spec player (33) keep their own pages. Per view DOC_SLOTS strings: title, kicker, then three (heading, text) pairs;
; an empty heading is no section. The Z rail of such a view is its sections, each a link into the document (#dN).
